  "hilfen": [],
  "hasSol": false,
  "task_html": "<div class='task-block' style='background:#7c3aed18;border:1.5px solid #7c3aed40;'><div class='task-block-label' style='color:#7c3aed;'>Geradenschar &ndash; Ein Geheimnis</div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border:1.5px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;'>Eine <strong>Geradenschar</strong> ist eine Familie von Geraden, die alle von einem Parameter k abh&auml;ngen. Hier ist die Schar:<div style='text-align:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#6d28d9;margin:6px 0 2px;'>f<sub>k</sub>(x) = kx + (3 &minus; k)</div><span style='font-size:12px;color:#666;'>Beispiele: f<sub>1</sub>(x) = x + 2 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; f<sub>2</sub>(x) = 2x + 1 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; f<sub>3</sub>(x) = 3x &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; f<sub>0</sub>(x) = 3 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; f<sub>-1</sub>(x) = &minus;x + 4</span></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 240 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:200px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='240' height='200' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='10' y1='140' x2='230' y2='140' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='60' y1='8' x2='60' y2='192' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='35' y1='8' x2='35' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='85' y1='8' x2='85' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='110' y1='8' x2='110' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='135' y1='8' x2='135' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='160' y1='8' x2='160' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='115' x2='230' y2='115' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='90' x2='230' y2='90' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='65' x2='230' y2='65' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='40' x2='230' y2='40' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><text x='35' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>-1</text><text x='85' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>1</text><text x='110' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='135' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>3</text><text x='160' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='53' y='118' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>1</text><text x='53' y='93' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='53' y='68' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>3</text><text x='53' y='43' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><line x1='35' y1='15' x2='185' y2='165' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='10' y1='65' x2='230' y2='65' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='35' y1='115' x2='140' y2='10' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='35' y1='165' x2='115' y2='5' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='48' y1='178' x2='105' y2='5' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='85' cy='65' r='7' fill='white' stroke='#6d28d9' stroke-width='2'/><text x='85' y='69' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='700'>?</text><text x='120' y='192' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-style='italic'>Was haben alle f&#x2096; gemeinsam?</text></svg></div><div style='display:grid;gap:8px;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>a)</span> Berechne f<sub>k</sub>(1) f&uuml;r k = &minus;1, 0, 1, 2, 3. Was f&auml;llt auf?</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>b)</span> Formuliere eine Vermutung: Durch welchen gemeinsamen Punkt gehen alle Geraden der Schar?</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>c)</span> Beweise algebraisch: Zeige, dass f<sub>k</sub>(1) = 3 f&uuml;r <em>jedes</em> k gilt. Nutze dazu f<sub>k</sub>(x) = kx + (3 &minus; k).</div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;'><span style='font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;'>d) Bonus:</span> Gibt es eine Gerade durch P(1|3), die <em>nicht</em> in der Schar liegt? Wenn ja, welche?</div></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;'><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.2;'><strong style='font-family:sans-serif;'>a) Einsetzen von x = 1:</strong><br>f<sub style='font-family:sans-serif;'>-1</sub>(1) = &minus;1 + 4 = <strong>3</strong><br>f<sub style='font-family:sans-serif;'>0</sub>(1) = 3 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;= <strong>3</strong><br>f<sub style='font-family:sans-serif;'>1</sub>(1) = 1 + 2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;= <strong>3</strong><br>f<sub style='font-family:sans-serif;'>2</sub>(1) = 2 + 1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;= <strong>3</strong><br>f<sub style='font-family:sans-serif;'>3</sub>(1) = 3 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;= <strong>3</strong></div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;'><strong>b) Vermutung:</strong> Alle Geraden der Schar gehen durch <strong>P(1|3)</strong>.</div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.2;'><strong style='font-family:sans-serif;'>c) Algebraischer Beweis:</strong><br>f&#x2096;(1) = k &middot; 1 + (3 &minus; k)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = k + 3 &minus; k<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; = <strong>3</strong> &nbsp; (unabh&auml;ngig von k!) &#x2714;</div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 14px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 240 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-height:200px;'><rect x='0' y='0' width='240' height='200' rx='12' fill='#f5f3ff'/><line x1='10' y1='140' x2='230' y2='140' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='60' y1='8' x2='60' y2='192' stroke='#c4b5fd' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='35' y1='8' x2='35' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='85' y1='8' x2='85' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='110' y1='8' x2='110' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='135' y1='8' x2='135' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='160' y1='8' x2='160' y2='192' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='115' x2='230' y2='115' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='90' x2='230' y2='90' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='65' x2='230' y2='65' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='10' y1='40' x2='230' y2='40' stroke='#ede9fe' stroke-width='0.7'/><text x='35' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>-1</text><text x='85' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>1</text><text x='110' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='135' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>3</text><text x='160' y='152' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><text x='53' y='118' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>1</text><text x='53' y='93' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>2</text><text x='53' y='68' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>3</text><text x='53' y='43' text-anchor='end' font-size='11' fill='#a78bfa'>4</text><line x1='35' y1='15' x2='185' y2='165' stroke='#d97706' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='10' y1='65' x2='230' y2='65' stroke='#6b7280' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='35' y1='115' x2='140' y2='10' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='35' y1='165' x2='115' y2='5' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='48' y1='178' x2='105' y2='5' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='85' cy='65' r='6' fill='#6d28d9' stroke='white' stroke-width='2'/><text x='92' y='60' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-weight='800'>P(1|3)</text><text x='120' y='192' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#6d28d9' font-style='italic'>Alle f&#x2096; durch P(1|3)!</text></svg></div><div style='background:#ede9fe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;'><strong>d) Bonus:</strong> Ja! Die <strong>senkrechte Gerade x = 1</strong> geht durch P(1|3), geh&ouml;rt aber nicht zur Schar &ndash; sie ist keine Funktion (kein eindeutiges y f&uuml;r jedes x). Das ist die einzige Gerade durch P, die fehlt.</div></div>"
}
